ras/Title_michael.png?t=1749013653\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Gif_Michael_v2.gif?t=1749013653\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto wasn\u2019t Nory\u2019s first experiment. One of them was named Michael. But Michael went and split himself into two, then four, then eight\u2014until there were way too many for any bunny to handle! Now, the Michaels are lost, scattered across the world. Find them, rescue them, bring them home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_friends.png?t=1749013653\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Gif_Friends_v2.gif?t=1749013653\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along your journey, you'll encounter a cast of wild and quirky characters, each with their own eccentric personalities and... problems. Lend them a hand, and they might just return the favor with useful items, hidden secrets, or unexpected abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_outfits.png?t=1749013653\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Gif_Outfits_v2.gif?t=1749013653\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto can unlock a variety of fun and stylish costumes, from the effortlessly cool to the absolutely ridiculous. Saving the world is important - but who says you can\u2019t look fashionable while doing it?</p><p cl